<title>FINLAND: Partek Jan-Apr profit rises to FIM 51 mln.</title>
<headline>Partek Jan-Apr profit rises to FIM 51 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless</p>
<p>stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		  50.8 vs 9.2</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.78 vs 0.13</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,949 vs 2,007</p>
<p> Operating profit				  74.7 vs 41.6</p>
<p>Share in results of</p>
<p> associated companies		  gain    2.3 vs 1.4 charge</p>
<p> Net financial items		   charge 26.2 vs 31.0 charge</p>
<p> Minorities				charge  6.1 vs  1.6 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						14.2 vs  2.6</p>
<p> Net profit					 22.9 vs  7.2 loss</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	   38.0 vs 28.6</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE) (percent)	    3.7 vs  1.1</p>
<p> Return on investment (ROI) (percent)	4.3 vs  5.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Partek Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
